 survival gameplay fused with immersive sim sandbox (lite) gameplay for the first time! Destroy the environment, mix elements, set traps, and use anything to build own play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create wild weapon combos!</strong> Strap knives to slippers and shred hundreds of fiends or make a bazooka out of fireworks and a pipe to blow up everything in sight. Experiment to uncover fun new combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for your life!</strong> Use a large array of distinct automated combos made of punches, kicks, uppercuts, drop kicks, ground slams and a whole lot more to fight your your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and play as new survivors!</strong> Build your army with an eclectic group of fighters who all have their own attacks and specials. They include include martial arts masters, shouting socialites, cats, and even a high top wearing Shiba Inu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Conquer!</strong> Unlock &gt;100 weapons and passives to create the ultimate build! Earn cash during runs, and buy upgrades to increase your chance of survival.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The City is Yours!</strong> Fight through the desolate streets of Times Square, a zoo filled with mutant animals, and dank subway tunnels filled with speeding trains and hidden terrors. Battle monstrous bosses including a cyborg wrestler, vampire bikers, an ice troll in yoga pants, and more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["NuChallenger"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383040/b8fceeece7b205ad52abf5b842816d73f10a03b5/header.jpg?t=1771962570","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 NuChallenger","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul